    "9": "{nama} practiced Conditional Rendering with v-if, v-else-if, and v-else directives. {nama} also explored applying Two-Way Data Binding using v-model on form inputs, and combining conditional rendering and two-way binding on web components.",
    "10": "{nama} practiced rendering data collections using List Rendering (v-for). {nama} also explored manipulating arrays and rendering object data dynamically, and polishing website project interface with list rendering.",
