    "14": "{nama} learned about Vue project folder structure and Single File Components. {nama} was also introduced to Composition API and Lifecycle Hooks in Vue 3, and building a recipe web page by invoking modular components.",
    "15": "{nama} practiced applying Props to pass data between components. {nama} was also introduced to Vue Router for multi-page SPA navigation, and building Home, Login, and Signup pages using routing.",
    "16": "{nama} was introduced to centralized State Management with Vuex. {nama} also learned about async/await in JavaScript and Axios HTTP client, and connecting the application to Firebase and fetching recipe data via API.",
    "17": "{nama} focused on creating Dynamic Routes with URL parameters in Vue Router. {nama} also practiced displaying recipe details based on ID parameter in detail page.",
